# iosfc_gap_mixed_ring: One doorbell over a ring of mixed commands, run in order with one interrupt each and every status written back: unsupported commands (0, 4, 0xffffffff) with any mapping ID, a map, the same map again (success, nothing re-created), a test and an unmap of an ID never mapped, an unmap, a test after it, and IDs 0 and 8191.
